{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Noir Total is a 2D local multiplayer PvP shooter set in darkened arenas. Sneak through total darkness using your controller\u2019s vibrations, track down your enemies, collect bonuses and set traps to stay one step ahead of your opponents in fast-paced, competitive matches for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way in the dark with controller vibrations that activate when your character moves over key elements of the map or comes into contact with another player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435580/extras/GIF2_V1.png?t=1744534526\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt down your opponents, anticipate their movements and take them out from the shadows! To be the best at Noir Total, you\u2019ll need to get inside your enemies\u2019 heads. Skill alone won\u2019t be enough!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435580/extras/GIF3_V1.png?t=1744534526\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up unique weapons to gain a major tactical advantage. A shotgun will be deadly in tight corridors, while an SMG will be your best friend in open spaces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn on your flashlight if you're lost or to secure a clean kill! But be careful, it will also make you vulnerable! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435580/extras/GIF4_V1.png?t=1744534526\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each round, you can replay the last action in full light to review every player's movements! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off in diverse environments that will put your mind to the test. Whatever happens, try to avoid the scattered light sources as much as possible! More than 20 maps are available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435580/extras/GIF7_V1.png?t=1744534526\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435580?t=1744534526","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435580?t=1744534526","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435580/332117e2c2a78ae6dd849e5c79d0976ccb583646/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744534526","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435580/332117e2c2a78ae6dd849e5c79d0976ccb583646/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744534526","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Noir Total is a 2D local multiplayer PvP shooter set in darkened arenas. Sneak through total darkness using your controller\u2019s vibrations, track down your enemies, collect bonuses and set traps to stay one step ahead of your opponents in fast-paced, competitive matches for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way in the dark with controller vibrations that activate when your character moves over key elements of the map or comes into contact with another player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435580/extras/GIF2_V1.png?t=1744534526\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt down your opponents, anticipate their movements and take them out from the shadows! To be the best at Noir Total, you\u2019ll need to get inside your enemies\u2019 heads. Skill alone won\u2019t be enough!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435580/extras/GIF3_V1.png?t=1744534526\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up unique weapons to gain a major tactical advantage. A shotgun will be deadly in tight corridors, while an SMG will be your best friend in open spaces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn on your flashlight if you're lost or to secure a clean kill! But be careful, it will also make you vulnerable! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435580/extras/GIF4_V1.png?t=1744534526\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each round, you can replay the last action in full light to review every player's movements! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off in diverse environments that will put your mind to the test. Whatever happens, try to avoid the scattered light sources as much as possible! More than 20 maps are available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435580/extras/GIF7_V1.png?t=1744534526\" /></p>","developers":["Copau GameDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435580/97